    <h2>How this site is accessible</h2>
    <ul><li>Access keys ::: for the header, main content and footer, plus a skip link.</li><li>The homepage carousel can be paused and operated by keyboard.</li><li>Text contrast is at least 4.5:1; form borders and icons at least 3:1.</li><li>Status labels use words as well as colour.</li><li>Every form field has a visible label and format hint.</li><li>Images have text alternatives; decorative images are hidden from screen readers.</li><li>Links that open a new window say so.</li><li>Pages work at 320 px wide and at 200% zoom.</li><li>Every page is available in Chinese and English.</li></ul>
    <h2>Feedback</h2>
